# .claudeignore — keep Grep/Glob/Explore out of noise.
# Token optimization 2026-07-24. Excludes full-repo-copy worktrees + build scratch.
# ⚠ Does NOT ignore archive/ or board/ (both referenced/live). If a rule stops
# finding something you need, remove the offending line.

# --- Worktrees: each is a FULL repo copy → every search matches N× over ---
# Covers .wt/ .worktrees/ worktrees/ .claude/worktrees/ repo/.claude/worktrees/
.wt/
.worktrees/
**/worktrees/
# Root-level worktree dirs with ad-hoc names
wt-*/
wave*/
*-worktree/

# --- Build / verifier scratch (regenerated, never source) ---
.vendor-run-*/
.verifier_out/
**/bundled/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/

# --- Lockfiles, binaries, DBs (never usefully grep-read) ---
*.lock
**/package-lock.json
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# NOTE: deliberately NOT ignoring mcp-apps-poc/data/ (counts.json = live SSOT read)
# or mcp-apps-poc/kernels/ (grepped during kernel work).
